<title>UK: Algeria raises Nov LPG by $25-30/tonne - trade.</title>
<headline>Algeria raises Nov LPG by $25-30/tonne - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's Sonatrach raised its November prices for liquefied petroleum gas by $25-$30 per tonne to $265 for propane and $260 for butane, traders said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
